{"availability":"available","full":"rakshit-737/PlantPal-Plus","name":"PlantPal-Plus","description":"PlantPal+: one app for three daily habits (plant care with species-and-season-aware watering, fitness and nutrition) and one streak. TypeScript monorepo: React web app, Expo mobile app, Express API on Supabase. Built from an IEEE-830 requirements package.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-21T16:51:03Z","updated":"2026-10-04T10:44:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://plant-pal-plus.vercel.app","topics":["expo","express","fitness-tracker","habit-tracker","monorepo","nodejs","nutrition-tracker","plant-care","postgresql","react","react-native","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel","vite"],"demo":"https://plant-pal-plus.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.974Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.974Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.974Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.974Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Plant care, fitness and nutrition in one daily ritual, with one streak.","[]( []( [](LICENSE) [](03implementation/package.json) [](03implementation/tsconfig.base.json)","Watering plants, moving every day and eating well are all daily habits that run on the same loop: schedule, remind, log, keep the streak, look back. Most people juggle three apps for them, with three logins and three streams of notifications. PlantPal+ builds the loop once and runs all three habits through it: one dashboard, one reminder engine and one streak that counts a day when every habit you track is done."],"features":["PlantPal+ is a wellness tracker, not a medical device. Energy and body-composition figures are estimates."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rakshit-737/PlantPal-Plus/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b5a3ff155204c6b77bad1f07012d4beca9af39c63d30221fcdedcfb130f3